    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Resurrection!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A high quality  shmup like those of the early 2000s</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729570/extras/e032e9759b56913561d0fc818edbd029.avif?t=1751380995\" width=720 height=366 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Locked and loaded!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your incredibly powerful weaponry to deal with a relentless assault of enemy forces\u00a0throughout 5 stages</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729570/extras/0c239b7907f36c6dbee4809966acc930.poster.avif?t=1751380995\" width=720 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729570/extras/0c239b7907f36c6dbee4809966acc930.webm?t=1751380995\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729570/extras/0c239b7907f36c6dbee4809966acc930.mp4?t=1751380995\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Overwhelmed?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your meddle with a difficulty that fits your skill level:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EASY:</strong> Specifically crafted difficulty curve for players brand new to the genre. Each stage gets more difficult than the one before, to help you get acclimated to the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NORMAL:</strong>\u00a0<i>Spicy!</i>\u00a0Flatter and increased difficulty curve to keep you on your toes as the stakes rise!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HARD:</strong>\u00a0For <span class=\"bb_strike\">deranged</span>\u00a0experienced arcade players! Every stage is similarly difficult so the first ones don't become a formality.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Also, make use of the robust practice mode to start any stage from any point until you become a true super player!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Resurrection!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A high quality  shmup like those of the early 2000s</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729570/extras/e032e9759b56913561d0fc818edbd029.avif?t=1751380995\" width=720 height=366 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Locked and loaded!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your incredibly powerful weaponry to deal with a relentless assault of enemy forces\u00a0throughout 5 stages</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729570/extras/0c239b7907f36c6dbee4809966acc930.poster.avif?t=1751380995\" width=720 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729570/extras/0c239b7907f36c6dbee4809966acc930.webm?t=1751380995\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729570/extras/0c239b7907f36c6dbee4809966acc930.mp4?t=1751380995\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Overwhelmed?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your meddle with a difficulty that fits your skill level:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EASY:</strong> Specifically crafted difficulty curve for players brand new to the genre. Each stage gets more difficult than the one before, to help you get acclimated to the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NORMAL:</strong>\u00a0<i>Spicy!</i>\u00a0Flatter and increased difficulty curve to keep you on your toes as the stakes rise!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HARD:</strong>\u00a0For <span class=\"bb_strike\">deranged</span>\u00a0experienced arcade players! Every stage is similarly difficult so the first ones don't become a formality.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Also, make use of the robust practice mode to start any stage from any point until you become a true super player!</p>",
